antId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-11b1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"这是不是女孩子间互相交换的制作出来的『杰作』的物品。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-11fd","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-11fd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但是……从钱包上哪里都看不出送出者的名字。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1239","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1239"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"人偶是少女的姿态。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1264","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-1264"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在本来要寄给的人是谁并不知道的情况下，该怎么做我也无法判明，但虽然如此就这么放置不管的话后果也相当棘手。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-12dc","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-12dc"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"如果。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-12fd","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-12fd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"被班内的谁发现的话…………","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-134a","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-134a"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"☆预想中的结果１","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev242/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-1375","target